Subject: [PATCH] zcip: fix -Wextra implicit-fallthrough

Trailing words after "fall through" break the =3 comment regex;
keep the explanation in a separate comment.
diff --git a/networking/zcip.c b/networking/zcip.c
index 311dfbe..1933c9a 100644
--- a/networking/zcip.c
+++ b/networking/zcip.c
@@ -432,7 +432,8 @@ int zcip_main(int argc UNUSED_PARAM, char **argv)
 				// NOTE: all other exit paths should deconfig...
 				if (QUIT)
 					return EXIT_SUCCESS;
-				// fall through: switch to MONITOR
+				/* switch to MONITOR */
+				/* fall through */
 			default:
 			// case DEFEND:
 			// case MONITOR: (shouldn't happen, MONITOR timeout is infinite)
